{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、なーこクッキングです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用意するものはこちら。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN51WKWPTP18CEDKCFQBS54","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n⚪︎カレーパン⚪︎卵⚪︎チーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜作り方〜\n①カレーパンの真ん中をくり抜きます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN51ZFFNB2K5838RBDJRW46","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n深めに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②その中に卵を割ります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN520X7HHPXCYZB280J7YYN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③その上にチーズをトッピングします。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN5227VKZ7JGFYHMQ1Y6QNP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"④トースター(電子レンジ)で焼きます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN5243XXZW325ZK2QSGVVWC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n(私が見える･･･笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑤こんな感じにチーズがとろけたら取り出します。私は焦げ目付き(*´∀`*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN526CMWPH0QESAB9MB3V52","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nチーズとカレーのいい香り❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⑥ナイフorフォークなどで、黄身を割ります。\nすると、半熟の卵が･･･♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN527KNEFZT2Q737T118EQV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n完成です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いただきます!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN528ZJK4EXBSK3Q3FP09VB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卵もとチーズとカレーって最高の組み合わせですよね(￣￢￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お部屋がカレーの匂いがします〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても簡単なのでぜひ、作ってみてください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}